# Why: formatters and tests expect LF; Git for Windows would otherwise check text out as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.fig binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
